     1577   ON CHOOSE OF b-sel IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1578   DO:
     1579     if ( available X_c-dc-hist ) then do:
     1580       if ( v-rid-list = "" ) or b-mark:sensitive = no
     1581       then
     1582       v-rid-list = string( recid( X_c-dc-hist ) ) .
     1583     end.
     1584   END.
     1585   ON MOUSE-SELECT-DBLCLICK OF br-dc-hist IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
